yiyiaddon — CREDITS
===================

yiyiaddon is a standalone Fabric client addon for Minecraft 26.1.2.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
ClickGUI / interface framework
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The ClickGUI in yiyiaddon is a port of the PVPUtils ClickGUI, ported from
Minecraft 1.21.11 to 26.1.2.

    Project:             PVPUtils
