----------------------------------------------------------------------
Baritone localisation
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The Baritone Chinese localisation (command names, help output, setting list,
status and error messages) is an independent integration layer that only
rewrites user-visible text. It bundles Baritone as an unmodified nested jar.

    Project:             Baritone
    Original Repository: https://github.com/cabaletta/baritone
    Build:               branch 26.1, commit 016cc210434894f371baf0c327ac94907d12dcd3,
                         version 1.18.0
    Licence:             GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0
    Licence text:        src/main/resources/LICENSE-baritone.txt

Baritone is not modified, is not shaded and keeps its own package names, so it
remains separately replaceable inside the published jar (LGPL-3.0 requirement).

